abstract: >-
  Measurement and configuration-search software for video-world-model inference
  and GPU operators. Historical measurements, synthetic software demonstrations,
  and pending full-model agent validation are documented separately. This
  software citation does not identify a peer-reviewed paper or a validated
  general-purpose kernel-writing benchmark.
